WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.010 --> 00:00:06.610
- [Nicole] We grew up
with only cheap doughnuts

00:00:06.610 --> 00:00:09.170
because nobody had gourmet
doughnuts back then.

00:00:09.170 --> 00:00:12.512
I'd have to say that I
prefer the classic stuff,

00:00:12.512 --> 00:00:15.196
like, simple is better.

00:00:17.241 --> 00:00:19.771
Smell-wise I can tell
you it smells the most

00:00:19.771 --> 00:00:22.090
fake a doughnut could possibly smell.

00:00:22.090 --> 00:00:25.490
It also happens to look
like a little butthole.

00:00:25.490 --> 00:00:26.551
It's nice and yellow.

00:00:26.551 --> 00:00:29.200
I mean, obviously, like everyone

00:00:29.246 --> 00:00:31.070
who grew up in the eighties and nineties

00:00:31.070 --> 00:00:32.408
has eaten one of these things.

00:00:32.408 --> 00:00:35.251
It leaves a greasy film
on the roof of my mouth

00:00:35.251 --> 00:00:36.891
which makes me sad.

00:00:36.891 --> 00:00:38.150
It seems like it might be, like,

00:00:38.150 --> 00:00:41.390
formed by some sort of,
like, injection gun.

00:00:41.390 --> 00:00:43.011
It's like foam inside.

00:00:43.011 --> 00:00:44.550
It's weird.

00:00:44.550 --> 00:00:47.170
I'm gonna give this two, a two stars.

00:00:49.429 --> 00:00:51.589
It looks like it came out of a package

00:00:51.589 --> 00:00:55.090
and it smells like some sort of weird oil.

00:00:55.090 --> 00:00:57.970
I wanna say that this is like palm oil.

00:00:57.970 --> 00:01:00.829
That's really bad and like,
killing the rain forest.

00:01:00.829 --> 00:01:04.928
Ah, so this doughnut feels,
like, soggy on the bottom

00:01:04.928 --> 00:01:06.127
and a little bit wet.

00:01:06.127 --> 00:01:07.349
I'm gonna take a really small bite

00:01:07.349 --> 00:01:08.288
'cause I'm not hopeful.

00:01:08.288 --> 00:01:10.389
'Cause it smells pretty bad.

00:01:10.389 --> 00:01:12.453
It's super gross.

00:01:12.453 --> 00:01:14.570
But it has that one
weird old school flavor

00:01:14.570 --> 00:01:18.829
where it's, like, fake
lemon and artificial nutmeg.

00:01:18.829 --> 00:01:20.928
It's both kind of, like, endearing

00:01:20.928 --> 00:01:23.068
and also really disgusting.

00:01:23.068 --> 00:01:26.043
Kind of like diet coke.

00:01:26.043 --> 00:01:28.213
One star.

00:01:29.643 --> 00:01:32.047
This doughnut is from Winchell's

00:01:32.047 --> 00:01:35.047
and it's really (beep) beautiful.

00:01:35.047 --> 00:01:37.668
Like it's the most beautiful doughnut

00:01:37.668 --> 00:01:39.089
I've seen in a long time.

00:01:39.089 --> 00:01:41.948
So, what you look for when
you're making a yeasted doughnut

00:01:41.948 --> 00:01:44.107
which is this risen glazed doughnut

00:01:44.107 --> 00:01:47.599
is that this line forms because

00:01:47.599 --> 00:01:50.167
the dough has risen at the proper time

00:01:50.167 --> 00:01:52.788
and developed in a way
where it's gonna cook

00:01:52.788 --> 00:01:54.689
evenly on both sides.

00:01:54.689 --> 00:01:56.609
But you can see the spice in here.

00:01:56.609 --> 00:01:58.850
I don't know if this is
the most expensive doughnut

00:01:58.850 --> 00:02:01.050
you bought but, like,
damn, it's pretty good.

00:02:01.050 --> 00:02:03.588
This is probably the
peak of cheap doughnuts

00:02:03.588 --> 00:02:05.486
and it's a five star doughnut.

00:02:05.486 --> 00:02:06.829
Kudos to this doughnut person.

00:02:06.829 --> 00:02:10.038
They really did a great job.

00:02:10.069 --> 00:02:14.668
So, this is a Dunkin' Donuts
raised glazed doughnut.

00:02:14.668 --> 00:02:18.756
It smells almost like nothing
which is really weird.

00:02:19.756 --> 00:02:21.029
Okay, so it smells really--

00:02:21.029 --> 00:02:22.990
It smells like it's got
some fake stuff in it.

00:02:22.990 --> 00:02:25.669
Like, fake vanilla.

00:02:25.669 --> 00:02:27.348
It's got a good texture, though, in terms

00:02:27.348 --> 00:02:29.047
of, like, the squish and stuff.

00:02:29.047 --> 00:02:31.677
But there's a really odd bitter flavor.

00:02:31.677 --> 00:02:34.740
This doughnut probably gets, like, a two.

00:02:37.739 --> 00:02:40.987
Probably the most hyped
doughnut in America.

00:02:40.987 --> 00:02:44.227
I have to say I'm a little
disappointed by this doughnut

00:02:44.227 --> 00:02:45.827
because it looks really flat

00:02:45.827 --> 00:02:48.008
and it feels really tight

00:02:48.008 --> 00:02:51.346
like either it's stale or that the person

00:02:51.346 --> 00:02:53.708
proofing the dough did not do a great job.

00:02:53.708 --> 00:02:55.169
The glaze it super thick.

00:02:55.169 --> 00:02:57.987
It almost feels like it's made out of wax.

00:02:57.987 --> 00:02:59.707
The inside of the dough has, like,

00:02:59.707 --> 00:03:01.028
no character at all.

00:03:01.028 --> 00:03:02.369
It's really white also.

00:03:02.369 --> 00:03:04.608
Basically, this is if you took wonderbread

00:03:04.608 --> 00:03:07.848
and fried it and then put glaze on it.

00:03:07.848 --> 00:03:11.268
It pains me to say it, a one star.

